# promise: #679
# #635 in a full-screen window (#679): out of the Library by a swipe, the hidden sidebar hides again with the pointer
# resting where it was, and the edge strip waits for the pointer to move before bringing the floating sidebar out.
# In a 22 Nov 2026 probe with a real pointer resting at the screen's left edge, it came out once before the swipe and
# not again after it. It takes over a Space, so it runs only with CRA_SCENARIO_SCREEN=1.
requires screen
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
