cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=hidden-library-full
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://debug?fullscreen=1
wait 4
cra://debug?windowState=full
expect-log window state full: main0 fullscreen=1 .* lightsHidden=1
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=stillstart
expect-log floating sidebar stillstart: waits=0
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=hold
wait 1
cra://debug?swipe=30,25
wait 2
expect-log library swipe from the hidden sidebar: lands docked
cra://debug?windowState=library
expect-log window state library: main0 fullscreen=1 .* lightsHidden=0
